"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" and enter the receiving server\/peer’s address.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Press ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Broadcast"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". The generated image moves while the connection is active.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Press ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" to close the connection and stop generating media.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The source is 1280 × 720 at 30 fps, encoded as H.264 at 2.5 Mbps with AAC audio","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at 48 kHz \/ 128 kbps. The stereo test tone is 440 Hz on the left and 880 Hz on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the right. It is sent to the stream, not played through the local speakers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"No camera or microphone is opened and no capture permission is needed.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The simulator requests software video encoding; actual encoder availability and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"performance depend on the OS\/device. See ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HaishinKit\/documentation\/HaishinKit\/codec-support"},{"text":" for capability reports.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Window-controls","type":"heading","text":"Window controls"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The main window separates video from connection controls. ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Fill video"}]},{"text":" in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lower glass toolbar switches between fitting the complete image and filling the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view (which may crop it). ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Device codecs"}]},{"text":" opens the system capability report,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"including its clipboard action.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Connection fields remain in memory for the current window. The selected mode is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remembered between launches. Main-window source labels omit stream keys,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credentials and URL query options. Closing the window stops its session.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Camera-access","type":"heading","text":"Camera access"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This example does not capture the Apple Vision Pro’s main camera. Apple’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/documentation\/visionos\/accessing-the-main-camera"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is an enterprise API requiring a separately approved entitlement. Synthetic test","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"signals allow publishing to be exercised without that entitlement.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Pending-RTMP-connections","type":"heading","text":"Pending RTMP connections"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A TCP server that accepts a connection without replying to the RTMP handshake can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leave the current shared session waiting indefinitely. Closing a pending session","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is a known transport limitation being addressed separately; this studio does not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"add a per-window handshake deadline.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/visionos/accessing-the-main-camera":{"id